  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and saute until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped bell pepper and scotch bonnet pepper and saute for another 2 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and saute for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the almond paste and stir to combine, cooking for 1 minute.",
    "Add the thyme, allspice, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Deglaze the skillet with a little water, scraping up any browned bits from the bottom.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 5 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
